<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Chinese 4 · Paper B · Optional preparation</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-4/b/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 4 Course Review · Original Paper B</p><h1>Optional preparation</h1><p>40 objective questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks · 100-minute section budget.</p><p class="note">Reference materials. Open the workspace for section clocks, local answer saving and recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or your own teacher; no automatic grade.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="student-traditional.html">繁體試卷</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Chinese 4 B</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><section class="box"><p>Optional before-practice support. No pinyin is shown in the learner paper. This is an author-selected list, not a complete calibrated word list.</p><p class="cn">食谱 <span class="note">recipe</span></p><p class="cn">秤 <span class="note">weighing scale</span></p><p class="cn">配菜 <span class="note">vegetable accompaniment</span></p><p class="cn">版本 <span class="note">version</span></p><p class="cn">采购 <span class="note">purchase supplies</span></p><p class="cn">结算 <span class="note">settle costs</span></p><p class="cn">注明 <span class="note">state explicitly</span></p><p class="cn">清单 <span class="note">list</span></p><p class="cn">占用 <span class="note">occupied</span></p><p class="cn">状态 <span class="note">status</span></p><p class="cn">管理员 <span class="note">room supervisor</span></p><p class="cn">试行 <span class="note">pilot arrangement</span></p><p class="cn">合唱 <span class="note">choir</span></p><p class="cn">乐谱 <span class="note">musical score</span></p><p class="cn">合唱团 <span class="note">choir</span></p><p class="cn">时机 <span class="note">timing</span></p><p class="cn">水龙头 <span class="note">tap</span></p><p class="cn">总量 <span class="note">total volume</span></p><p class="cn">数据 <span class="note">data</span></p><p class="cn">更正 <span class="note">correct</span></p><p class="cn">预约屏 <span class="note">booking kiosk</span></p><p class="cn">确认按钮 <span class="note">confirmation button</span></p><p class="cn">兼顾 <span class="note">consider both needs</span></p><p class="cn">无从下手 <span class="note">not know where to start</span></p><p class="cn">索引 <span class="note">index</span></p><p class="cn">类别 <span class="note">category</span></p><p class="cn">炉火 <span class="note">cooking heat</span></p><p class="cn">适用条件 <span class="note">conditions of use</span></p><p class="cn">候补 <span class="note">waiting list</span></p><p class="cn">擅自 <span class="note">without authorization</span></p><p class="cn">关键词 <span class="note">key terms</span></p><p class="cn">逐句 <span class="note">sentence by sentence</span></p><p class="cn">确认编号 <span class="note">confirmation reference</span></p><p class="cn">联系人 <span class="note">contact person</span></p><p class="cn">交接 <span class="note">handover</span></p><p class="cn">归位 <span class="note">restore to position</span></p><p class="cn">乐理 <span class="note">music theory</span></p><p class="cn">节奏 <span class="note">rhythm</span></p><p class="cn">成品 <span class="note">finished recording</span></p><p class="cn">轻视 <span class="note">disrespect</span></p><p class="cn">泥土 <span class="note">soil</span></p><p class="cn">接替 <span class="note">take over</span></p><p class="cn">照护 <span class="note">care</span></p><p class="cn">未检查 <span class="note">not checked</span></p><p class="cn">语音朗读 <span class="note">spoken screen reading</span></p><p class="cn">覆盖 <span class="note">cover/support</span></p><p class="cn">克数 <span class="note">gram measurements</span></p><p class="cn">份量 <span class="note">portion size</span></p></section></main></body></html>